{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"pass\": true,\n  \"problems\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"reason\": \"四条听感都有合理去处，尤其是最重要的突然落定感，既由M43解释了整段经历为何在终结时第一次整体成为过去，也由M40解释了最后的收拢与终止；M31和M36则分别保留了身体承受力耗尽与旧日亲近重新浮现这两种不同原因，没有把它们混成单一的感情解释。四条候选均保留原话，历史依赖已有对应的听感解释，回归的音乐动机也没有被误判为对方的真实回应或关系恢复；理由虽有概括，但具体联系了身体极限、旧日亲近和整段经历的终结，没有达到必须判不合格的程度。\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e2e30970-4595-4c60-a5ee-1aba3e07e0fe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T121017773632Z", "elapsed_seconds": 295.562, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T12:15:13.356169+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "990c6cc563582261eba53872e55b26d7d1f2538903b3876c80b0565f9abdfbdf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete"